design-system#59 — ci: create every staticDirs root, so a clean checkout can build Storybook

Reproduced on a clean worktree of origin/main (no local mockups/brand present, matching CI's
cleanCheckout):

  before:
    $ node ui/scripts/stage-static.mjs
    staged 0 mockup surfaces, brand marks, packages/tokens and foundation/fonts into ui/.static
    $ ls ui/.static/
    foundation  packages          <- no `apps`
    $ npm --prefix ui run build-storybook
    Error: Failed to load static files, no such directory: .../ui/.static/apps

  after:
    $ ls ui/.static/
    apps  foundation  packages
    $ npm --prefix ui run build-storybook
    ✓ built in 4.12s

Evidence the sources are untracked, which is why this only ever failed in CI:
    $ git ls-files 'apps/*/brand/*'   | wc -l   -> 0
    $ git ls-files 'apps/*/mockups/*' | wc -l   -> 0

TeamCity: ByteDesk_DesignSystem_CiValidate builds 205-212 all FAILURE, including build 2077 on
branch `main`, all with the same error.
